    "tts_text": "ストックホルム来たら、地下鉄が高すぎた！",
    "caption": "",
    "at": 0
   },
   {
    "text": "親友んちに居候中。地下鉄、なんと……",
    "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/nG_voice/out/p1/02.wav",
    "tts_text": "しんゆうんちに居候中。地下鉄、なんと",
    "at": 73
   },
   {
    "text": "1回700円やって！",
    "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/nG_voice/out/p1/03.wav",
    "tts_text": "一回七百円やって！",
    "at": 170,
    "big": "shake_white",
    "split": "1回｜700円やって！"
   },
   {
    "text": "もう引きこもろ。",
    "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/nG_voice/out/p1/04.wav",
    "tts_text": "もう引きこもろ。",
    "at": 217,
    "mood": "tense_still"
   },
   {
    "text": "でもこの街、好きすぎる！",
    "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/nG_voice/out/p1/05.wav",
    "tts_text": "でもこの街、好きすぎる！",
    "at": 252,
    "mood": "up_pop"
   },
   {
    "text": "1週間乗り放題、7800円課金や！",
    "audio": "/tmp/claude-0/-home-user-live-streaming/7b54307b-9720-512c-9147-76f79b3cf92a/scratchpad/nG_voice/out/p1/06.wav",
    "tts_text": "一週間乗り放題、七千八百円課金や！",
    "at": 309
